# Do not commit docs/distribution

`docs/distribution/` is an internal colleague checklist and grant drafts (often Russian). Do not stage, commit, or include it in GitHub factory publishes. It is gitignored. Do not `git add -f` it.

Public English comment drafts that must be posted on GitHub issues are not this folder.

```bash
# BAD — forces the ignored folder into the index
git add -f docs/distribution/
git add docs/distribution/colleague-tasks.md

# GOOD — leave the folder on disk and out of every commit and factory publish
git status --ignored -- docs/distribution
```
